### get userinfo with auth_token
GET {{ WLS_AUTH_SERVICE }}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### GET Wahlvorstand | user wls_all_uwb
GET {{ WLS_EAI_SERVICE_URL }}/wahlvorstaende?wahlbezirkID=9899cae4-df9a-4ffc-a940-f20cf2280171
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### GET Wahlvorstand | user wls_all_bwb
