Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### GET Wahlvorstand not found
GET {{ WLS_EAI_SERVICE_URL }}/wahlvorstaende?wahlbezirkID=wahlbezirkID_X
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

